{title: 565 - For the Beauty of the Earth}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #565 • DIX • 7.7.7.7.7.8}
{lyricist: Folliott S. Pierpoint}
{composer: Conrad Kocher}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 565}
{meta: tune DIX}
{meta: meter 7.7.7.7.7.8}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]For the beauty of [C/E]the [D7/F#]earth,
[C]For [D7/C]the [G/B]glory of [D]the [G]skies,
[G]For the love [D/F#]which [G]from [C/E]our [D7/F#]birth
[C]Over [G/B]and [C]around [D]us [G]lies;
[G]Lord [D7/F#]of [G]all, to [D/F#]Thee we [G]raise
[C]This our [D7/C]grateful [G/D]song [D7]of [G]praise.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]For the joy [D/F#]of [G]human [D7/F#]love,
[C]brother, [G/B]sister, parent, child,
[G]friends on earth [D/F#]and [G]friends [C/E]above,
[C]Pleasures [G/B]pure [C]and [G/D]undefiled,
[G]Lord [D7/F#]of [G]all, to [D/F#]Thee we [G]raise
[C]this our [D7/C]grateful [G/D]song [D7]of [G]praise.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]For the gift [D/F#]of [G]Thy [C/E]dear [D7/F#]Son,
[C]for the [D7/C]hope [G/B]of [C]heaven [D]at [G]last,
[G]for the Spirit's victory won,
[C]For [D7/C]the [G/B]crown [C]when [G/D]life [D]is [G]past,
[G]Lord [D7/F#]of [G]all, to [D/F#]Thee we [G]raise
[C]Songs [D7/C]of [G/B]gratitude [D7]and [G]praise.
{end_of_verse}
